## Outsourcing Resume Work

| User intent | Action |
|---|---|
| Pastes a **JD / link** | Invoke **@resume-pipeline**. |
| Asks to **grade** / "Am I competitive at X?" | Invoke **@resume-grading** with role context. |
| Asks **how to prep** for an interview/OA at X, or mentions interview progress | Use case 6: probe → tracker → read sources → prep coach. Do not outsource to `@resume-grading`. |

